  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A Brazilian surgeon named Italo Venturelli says that in January 1996, at the regional hospital in Varginha, Brazil, a reporter from TV Globo, a huge Brazilian TV network, asked him outright, \"Did you operate on the ET?\", meaning an extraterrestrial. He says the reporter caught him outside the hospital and that he held back from swearing only because it was Globo. He tells it on Jesse Michels's podcast as part of the story that a creature from elsewhere was brought to his hospital."
}
